SUMMARY:Deadline: Fonds BJP Press Play 2027: Development Programme for Jour
 nalistic Makers
DESCRIPTION:Press Play helps makers develop and pitch a journalistic or cre
 ative project\, with five places in each of four tracks: audio\, video\, w
 riting and photo. You do not need to be a professional journalist\, but yo
 u must attend in person in the Netherlands and work in Dutch\; past Fonds 
 BJP project-subsidy recipients and books\, comics and fiction are excluded
