 en)\nLocation: Netherlands (in person\; programme in Dutch)\nAward: EUR 3\
 ,200 towards about 20 days of time invested\, plus a personal coach and wo
 rkshops. No application fee.\nDuration: March to May 2027\n\nMore: https:/
